  "namespace_caveat": "Guides spend a large share of runtime on Mekanism GENERATORS (heat/solar/wind/gas-burning, fission, fusion) and on Mekanism TOOLS (paxels), but none of those ids exist in the `mekanism` namespace - they ship in the separate MekanismGenerators / MekanismTools modules. A scan of the core jar alone would conclude the mod has no power generation at all, which is the opposite of how every guide teaches it. The 'very first energy source' a beginner is told to build is a heat generator, which is NOT a `mekanism:` id."
